		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Killer whales that transform into orca-sized wolves upon land. Fierce hunters that dwell in perpetual blizzards.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +10 (2d8), <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blizzard Beast</strong>. Distant-width blizzard extends from akhlut at all times. Leaves no tracks in snow and ice.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. In the ocean, instantly change into an orca. On land, instantly change into an orca-sized black wolf.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
